  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Together we stand: supporting women rights actors in Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen and support two women&#x2019;s rights organizations, Hawa and Raja. These organizations work to strengthen women&#x2019;s participation and respect for women&#x2019;s rights, and the project will have a particular focus on GBV-protection in the governorates Diyala and Kirkuk. 

The project will systematically support women rights actors in working towards improved practices within the field of GBV and will support GBV-advocacy at local and national levels. The target groups are survivors of GBV, as well as a variety of stakeholders and duty-bearers responsible for preventing and responding to GBV.</narrative>
  </description>
